### Caixa-um API — coleção de requisições autenticadas
### Use com a extensão "REST Client" do VS Code.
###
### 1. Suba a API:  pnpm --filter @caixa1/api dev  (porta 8787)
### 2. Preencha @token com um JWT de sessão do Clerk (crie no painel do Clerk,
###    use um token de teste de uma org/user, ou gere via Web Session Token).
### 3. Preencha @accountId/@categoryId/@txId com IDs retornados nas respostas.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8787
@token = COLE-AQUI-SEU-JWT-DO-CLERK

# @accountId = troque pelo id retornado no POST /accounts
# @categoryId = troque pelo id retornado no POST /categories
# @txId = troque pelo id retornado no POST /transactions

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Health (PÚBLICO — sem token)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Sem token → deve dar 401
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Accounts
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Listar contas
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar conta (saldo inicial vira transação "Saldo inicial")
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conta Corrente",
  "type": "checking",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "initialBalance": 0
}

### Buscar conta
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar conta
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conta Corrente Renomeada"
}

### Saldo da conta (balanço vivo; arquivadas deixam de contar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Arquivar conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desarquivar conta
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/unarchive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excluir conta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Categories
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Listar categorias
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar categoria
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Supermercado",
  "type": "expense",
  "icon": "🛒",
  "color": "#22c55e"
}

### Atualizar categoria
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mercado"
}

### Excluir categoria
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Transactions
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Resumo do período ATENÇÃO: rota estática ANTES de /:id
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/summary?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar receita (income)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "income",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "amount": 100.0,
  "description": "Salário",
  "date": "2026-01-05"
}

### Criar despesa (expense)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "amount": 40.0,
  "description": "Mercado",
  "date": "2026-01-06"
}

### Criar transferência (transfer) — precisa de duas contas
### accountId2 = id de outra conta criada no POST /accounts
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "transfer",
  "fromAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "toAccountId": "{{accountId2}}",
  "amount": 30.0,
  "description": "Pix",
  "date": "2026-01-07"
}

### Listar transações (paginado, filtra por arquivadas por padrão)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=expense&limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar transação
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{txId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar transação (valor/descrição/data; reaplica efeito no saldo)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{txId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Mercadinho",
  "amount": 45.0
}

### Arquivar transação (reverte o efeito no saldo, some do journal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{txId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desarquivar transação (reaplica o efeito no saldo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{txId}}/unarchive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excluir transação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{txId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Journal (read-only — espelha transações aplicadas)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Exportar CSV ATENÇÃO: rota estática ANTES de /:id
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/export?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal?accountId={{accountId}}&limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Entry por ID (formato composto: <txId>-out / <txId>-in em transferências)
GET {{baseUrl}}/journal/{{txId}}-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Envelope de erro (exemplo de validação)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Corpo inválido → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "income",
  "accountId": "nao-e-um-uuid",
  "amount": 0,
  "date": "01/01/2026"
}